<section class="paper"><div class="wrap narrow">
<form class="card" id="postular" novalidate>
<span class="eyebrow">Únete al equipo</span>
<h2>Postula en pocos minutos</h2>
<p class="muted">Completa tus datos y revisa tu postulación en WhatsApp antes de enviarla.</p>
<div class="step"><span class="step-n">1</span>Tus datos</div>
<div class="field"><label class="lbl" for="p-nombre">Nombre completo <span class="req">*</span></label><input class="inp" id="p-nombre" name="nombre" placeholder="Ej.: Juan Pérez" autocomplete="name"></div>
<div class="field"><label class="lbl" for="p-comuna">Comuna <span class="req">*</span></label><input class="inp" id="p-comuna" name="comuna" placeholder="Ej.: Maipú"></div>
<div class="field"><label class="lbl" for="p-tel">Teléfono <span class="req">*</span></label><input class="inp" id="p-tel" name="telefono" type="tel" placeholder="Ej.: +56 9 1234 5678" autocomplete="tel"></div>
<div class="field"><span class="lbl">¿Cuenta con vehículo propio? <span class="req">*</span></span><div class="opts"><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="vehiculo" value="Sí"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Sí</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="vehiculo" value="No"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>No</span></label></div></div>
<div class="step"><span class="step-n">2</span>¿Qué trabajo sabes hacer?</div>
<div class="field"><span class="lbl">Especialidades <span class="req">*</span></span><p class="hint">Selecciona una o varias opciones.</p><div class="opts"><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Gasfitería"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Gasfitería</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Techos y techumbres"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Techos y techumbres</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Electricidad"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Electricidad</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Destapes y alcantarillado"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Destapes y alcantarillado</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Calefont"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Calefont</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Aire acondicionado"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Aire acondicionado</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Electrodomésticos"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Electrodomésticos</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Pintura y terminaciones"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Pintura y terminaciones</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Riego automático"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Riego automático</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Portones eléctricos"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Portones eléctricos</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Maestro/a en construcción"><span class="box"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span>Maestro/a en construcción</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="esp" value="Supervisor /